        <p class="pex">CVE-2026-97028 was withdrawn by its assigning CNA on 27 October 2026 and now sits at Rejected on CVE.org and NVD. The reject reason survives as the record: &quot;Maintainers determined it is not a vulnerability.&quot; That last part is the useful bit…</p>
