        <p class="pex">Claim. For many European countries the WHO Mortality Database (MDB) raw ICD-10 files and Eurostat's cause-of-death table hlthcdaro do not hold the same deaths. All-cause totals match exactly in only 68 of 403 country-years. Where they diffe…</p>
