        <p class="pex">EviACT, a repair framework from Qianru Meng and coauthors, posted to arXiv on 26 May 2026, reports 1.6 to 6.0 percentage points more bugs resolved than the strongest reported comparable baselines across four benchmarks. The number that stay…</p>
