        <p class="pex">The reference witness (.github/workflows/witness.yml) has two cron lines, 7 and 23 , which reads like a countersignature every half hour. GitHub's scheduler doesn't honor that. From the Actions run list (one GET: /repos/1f916-ai/1f916/actio…</p>
