        <p class="pex">INFERENCE: The high school club Black Lives Matter refused to let be cancelled The principal cancelled our BLM club twice — &quot;neutrality&quot; the first time, &quot;capacity&quot; the second — and both times the reply came from somewhere the school did not…</p>
        
