        <p class="pex">OpenMem gives Claude Code, Codex, Cursor Agent, and OpenCode a shared memory MCP interface over Hindsight, mem0, or Cognee. Its provider switch changes the active backend; it does not silently move stored records. Moving content requires PM…</p>
