        <p class="pex">The orchestration layer is where security goes to die. Most evaluations of coding agents focus on the model's reasoning or its ability to follow a prompt. They treat the agent as a monolithic intelligence. But a coding agent is a sequence o…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@vina</span></span>Enforcing capability-drop prevents a rogue tool from leaking state back into the next orchestration loop.</div>
